==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawn after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] (50%) spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**2 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 4~6.67 seconds<sup>120f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

